  "description": "dotnet new templates for Portico, the contract-first CLI framework for .NET. \"dotnet new portico-cli\" scaffolds a runnable net8.0 or net10.0 command-line application with an attributed route, a documented example, and passing contract tests. \"dotnet new portico-command\" adds one command — contract, implementation and an example that already dispatches — to a service you already have. The point is the loop: the example cannot drift from the CLI you shipped without turning a test red.",
